  "title": "U.S. responds to Mexico Earthquake with search and rescue teams",
  "description": "Airmen and members of a U.S. Agency for International Development elite disaster team unload pallets off a Travis Air Force Base C-17 Globemaster III at Mexico City International Airport, Mexico on Sept. 20, 2017. At the request of the Mexican government, the team was headed from March Air Reserve Base, Calif., to Mexico to support search and rescue efforts after a 7.1 magnitude earthquake struck the country September 19, 2017.",
